#: includes/admin/class-oli-acr-admin.php:961
msgid "Your store saved guest carts without consent (\"Always\" mode). To comply with Quebec Law 25 and the GDPR, the update turned consent on: guests and logged-in customers are now tracked only when they check the consent box at checkout. You can turn it off again in the settings, under your own responsibility."
